5e7148e6c446fedaf4b%2F9d260ee8e85d43b2aa5ccbf53b5e527d\"}], \"Hockey\": [{\"id\": \"94668677-f83c-4ad3-b0f9-6e28ab8cb727\", \"title\": \"Wild make switch in net for Game 2, go with Gustavsson after Wallstedt allows 8 goals against Avs\", \"url\": \"https://apnews.com/article/wild-goaltender-avalanche-stanley-cup-a50d66d724cc906a927cd8ece941df68\", \"source\": \"AP Sports\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"summary\": \": denver (ap)) ):) ) ee)t) \\u03c2) tambi\\u00e9n)\\u0435) \\u0646\\u06cc\\u0632))\\u0435 )\\u0435.\", \"importance_score\": 10, \"keywords\": [\"wild\", \"gustavsson\", \"game\", \"goals\", \"against\"], \"image_url\": \"https://dims.apnews.com/dims4/default/e28fb82/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5199x3464+0+1/resize/980x653!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.apnews.com%2F58%2F95%2F196b6dcbdbfe621dd3e8ab758331%2Fa9393c2baa234551928331ca63ef62fc\"}, {\"id\": \"685c2e64-2425-40fc-9605-f05eb6712248\", \"title\": \"Alcoyano-Sanse y Reus-Ourense, los duelos estelares en el playoff de ascenso de 1\\u00aa Federaci\\u00f3n\", \"url\": \"https://www.marca.com/futbol/2026/05/04/alcoyano-sanse-reus-ourense-duelos-estelares-playoff-ascenso-1-federacion.html\", \"source\": \"Marca\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"summary\": \"De ascenso a primera federaci\\u00f3n - P\\u00e1gina 2 - 1 - 3 - 4 - 5.\", \"importance_score\": 5, \"keywords\": [\"federaci\\u00f3n\", \"emparejamientos\", \"primera\", \"sorteo\", \"este\"], \"image_url\": \"https://objetos-xlk.estaticos-marca.com/files/article_main_microformat/uploads/2026/05/04/69f88bd4126a4.jpeg\"}]}, \"articles\": [{\"id\": \"c0d143b3-a11a-49d1-9b03-79c6a299254d\", \"title\": \"Bordal\\u00e1s, adi\\u00f3s al Getafe\", \"url\": \"https://www.marca.com/futbol/getafe/2026/05/04/adios-bordalas-realidad-celestini-primera-opcion-paunovic-alternativa.html\", \"source\": \"Marca\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Football\", \"summary\": \"A bordal\\u00e1s y el t\\u00e9cnico no quiso firmar en el verano pasado.\", \"full_content\": \"\\u00c1ngel Torres ofreci\\u00f3 la renovaci\\u00f3n hasta 2028 a Bordal\\u00e1s, pero el t\\u00e9cnico no quiso firmar despu\\u00e9s de una temporada muy complicada por los problemas de l\\u00edmite salarial \\\"No merezco lo que estoy pasando esta temporada. Esto no se lo deseo a nadie\\\". La frase de Jos\\u00e9 Bordal\\u00e1s el 9 de enero tras perder en el Coliseum ante la Real Sociedad mostr\\u00f3 por vez primera desde que lleg\\u00f3 a Getafe el abatimiento de quien ve\\u00eda que la delicada situaci\\u00f3n del club con el l\\u00edmite salarial le estaba llevando a una situaci\\u00f3n insostenible, sin delanteros en la plantilla a los que poder alinear. El t\\u00e9cnico, que acaba contrato el 30 de junio, ten\\u00eda claro que no pod\\u00eda seguir as\\u00ed en el banquillo de un Getafe que lleva a\\u00f1os lastrado por sus problemas econ\\u00f3micos. Y eso a pesar de que tiene desde el verano pasado una oferta de renovaci\\u00f3n hasta 2028. Su relaci\\u00f3n personal con el presidente \\u00c1ngel Torres ha sido muy buena a lo largo de todos estos a\\u00f1os, aunque en lo profesional se han deteriorado por los problemas econ\\u00f3micos del club en esta segunda etapa. Los mensajes del entrenador en rueda de prensa no han faltado estos a\\u00f1os y especialmente esta temporada ante lo que consideraba Bordal\\u00e1s una plantilla que no atend\\u00eda las necesidades m\\u00ednimas: \\\"Necesitamos fichajes de forma urgente\\\", ha repetido una y otra vez el que ha sido el mejor entrenador de la historia del Getafe. Esta temporada la desaz\\u00f3n del entrenador con la plantilla que ten\\u00eda fue mayor que nunca. Las ventas de Alderete y Uche, dos de sus futbolistas m\\u00e1s importantes, unido a que el Getafe inscribi\\u00f3 a seis de sus fichajes el \\u00faltimo d\\u00eda del mercado de verano y que la plantilla ten\\u00eda seis fichas libres por la falta de l\\u00edmite salarial hizo que Bordal\\u00e1s estallara por la falta de futbolistas especialmente de ataque. Estos seis primeros meses de Liga fueron muy complicados para un entrenador que en ning\\u00fan momento se plante\\u00f3 renovar por dos temporadas m\\u00e1s pese a la oferta del presidente. Jos\\u00e9 Bordal\\u00e1s, que ha cambiado recientemente de agencia de representaci\\u00f3n para ponerse en manos de YouFirst, espera encontrar una buena oferta fuera de Espa\\u00f1a despu\\u00e9s de su gran temporada en el Getafe: \\\"Mira que llevo a\\u00f1os en el Getafe, pero esta es la que m\\u00e1s m\\u00e9rito tiene. Es hist\\u00f3rica\\\", dice el t\\u00e9cnico azul\\u00f3n, que ha sonado este a\\u00f1o para el Crystal Palace. El club azul\\u00f3n se puso a trabajar en otras alternativas para el banquillo ante la postura de Bordal\\u00e1s de no aceptar la prolongaci\\u00f3n de su contrato que acababa el 30 de junio de 2026. \\u00c1ngel Torres ha tenido siempre en la rec\\u00e1mara a un viejo conocido como el suizo Fabio Celestini, que despu\\u00e9s de una gran temporada en el Basilea -fue campe\\u00f3n de la Superliga y la Copa suiza- firm\\u00f3 dos temporadas por el CSKA de Mosc\\u00fa hasta junio de 2027, aunque este lunes se ha anunciado su salida del club. Celestini fue uno de los futbolistas m\\u00e1s destacados del Getafe que lleg\\u00f3 a jugar en Europa y dos finales de Copa entre 2005 y 2010: \\\"Es mi casa, le tengo cari\\u00f1o\\\", dijo en una entrevista en Radio MARCA sobre la posibilidad de entrenar un d\\u00eda a los azulones. Actualmente marchaba sexto en la Liga rusa con el CSKA y aunque le quedaba un a\\u00f1o de contrato, el t\\u00e9cnico ha dejado de pertenecer al club ruso y su camino para marcharse al Getafe est\\u00e1 m\\u00e1s claro. Ya ha habido contactos con el t\\u00e9cnico suizo y s\\u00f3lo faltaba que se pudiera cerrar el acuerdo como as\\u00ed ha ocurrido hoy para que Celestini rescindiera su contrato con el CSKA y pudiera llegar a Getafe, ya que \\u00c1ngel Torres conf\\u00eda mucho en \\u00e9l. De hecho, el club moscovita llevaba tiempo sondeando opciones para su banquillo al dar por hecho que Celestini no seguir\\u00eda la pr\\u00f3xima temporada al frente del CSKA. Otro de los entrenadores que tiene apuntado en su agenda \\u00c1ngel Torres es Veljko Paunovic, el actual seleccionador serbio, que tiene una cl\\u00e1usula en su contrato con la Federaci\\u00f3n por la que podr\\u00eda salir si alg\\u00fan club con el que tenga lazos emocionales le quiere fichar. Y el Getafe es uno de esos clubes a los que Paunovic siente como suyo. De hecho, su hijo Petar juega en las categor\\u00edas inferiores del Getafe y ser\\u00eda un a\\u00f1adido para fichar por el club azul\\u00f3n. \\u00c1ngel Torres es un enamorado de Paunovic e incluso ha llegado a afirmar en sus c\\u00edrculos m\\u00e1s cercanos que \\\"si sigo en el Getafe, un d\\u00eda entrenar\\u00e1 al equipo\\\".\", \"keywords\": [\"getafe\", \"club\", \"para\", \"temporada\", \"\\u00e1ngel\"], \"importance_score\": 75, \"credibility\": 0.5, \"langue\": \"es\", \"image_url\": \"https://objetos-xlk.estaticos-marca.com/files/article_main_microformat/uploads/2026/05/04/69f88bb9f1019.jpeg\"}, {\"id\": \"01ec8c95-ee32-4d26-b65e-7eab28f46d4b\", \"title\": \"Arsenal-Atl\\u00e9tico: le r\\u00eave bris\\u00e9 d\'Antoine Griezmann, qui ne remportera jamais la Ligue des champions\", \"url\": \"https://rmcsport.bfmtv.com/football/ligue-des-champions/arsenal-atletico-le-reve-brise-d-antoine-griezmann-qui-ne-remportera-jamais-la-ligue-des-champions_AN-202605050942.html\", \"source\": \"RMC Sport\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Football\", \"summary\": \"De griezmann \\u00e0 l\'emirates stadium \\u00e0 londres.\", \"full_content\": \"C\'\\u00e9tait devenu son obsession, son dernier d\\u00e9fi, mais le r\\u00eave a finalement pris fin ce mardi sur la pelouse de l\'Emirates Stadium. Gagner enfin la Ligue des champions avec son club de coeur, \\u00e0 35 ans, avant de s\'envoler pour les Etats-Unis, pouvait permettre \\u00e0 Antoine Griezmann \\\"de panser une blessure tr\\u00e8s profonde\\\", comme il l\'indiquait dans une interview aupr\\u00e8s de l\'UEFA la semaine derni\\u00e8re. \\u00c0 l\'issue de la demi-finale aller face \\u00e0 Arsenal (1-1), les regrets \\u00e9taient pr\\u00e9sents. Les deux images de son match, une d\\u00e9viation g\\u00e9niale de la t\\u00eate pour l\'Argentin Julian Alvarez et une reprise du gauche venue s\'\\u00e9craser sur la barre, sont peut-\\u00eatre venues le hanter, des ann\\u00e9es apr\\u00e8s, comme ce p\\u00e9nalty rat\\u00e9, \\u00e9galement sur la barre, lors de la finale de C1 face au Real Madrid perdue ensuite aux tirs au but, il y a dix ans, quelques semaines avant une autre finale perdue \\u00e0 l\'Euro 2016 avec les Bleus. Mais ce mardi \\u00e0 Londres, la possibilit\\u00e9 d\'un \\\"grand r\\u00eave\\\" a pris fin, brutalement. Pourtant, Griezmann abordait ce rendez-vous \\\"plus calme, plus tranquille\\\", comme il l\'affirmait en conf\\u00e9rence de presse lundi. Et \\u00e0 l\'image du match aller, \\\"Grizou\\\" a tout donn\\u00e9, aurait pu obtenir un p\\u00e9nalty qui aurait pu changer la physionomie de ce duel, mais a assist\\u00e9 impuissant \\u00e0 une nouvelle d\\u00e9sillusion dure \\u00e0 encaisser avant de rejoindre Orlando \\u00e0 l\'issue de la saison. Il a perdu la bataille des num\\u00e9ros 7 qu\'il a men\\u00e9e \\u00e0 distance avec Saka, par la faute de David Raya, qui a \\u00e9cart\\u00e9 l\'une de ses frappes, et par celle de Diego Simeone, son entra\\u00eeneur depuis plus d\'une d\\u00e9cennie, qui l\'a sorti apr\\u00e8s une heure - quand il semblait accuser le coup physiquement. Regard dans le vide, le Fran\\u00e7ais est apparu tr\\u00e8s \\u00e9mu au moment d\'aller saluer les supporters apr\\u00e8s l\'\\u00e9limination des Madril\\u00e8nes. \\\"C\'est une l\\u00e9gende. J\'ai eu la chance de jouer avec lui en \\u00e9quipe de France. C\'est un top joueur, il nous a toujours pos\\u00e9 beaucoup de probl\\u00e8mes \\u00e0 l\'aller et au retour\\\", a salu\\u00e9 son compatriote William Saliba au micro de Canal+ au coup de sifflet final. Surtout que la Ligue des champions \\u00e9tait le dernier objectif majeur pour le champion du monde 2018, battu en finale de la Coupe du Roi et seulement 4e de Liga avec les Colchoneros. Depuis son arriv\\u00e9e en 2014 - il a effectu\\u00e9 deux saisons au Bar\\u00e7a entre 2019 et 2021 - Griezmann doit se contenter de trois titres: une Supercoupe d\'Espagne (2014), une Ligue Europa et une Supercoupe d\'Europe (2018). Un palmar\\u00e8s qui ne refl\\u00e8te pas le statut du meilleur buteur de l\'histoire du club (212 buts toutes comp\\u00e9titions confondues). Bayern-PSG: Fabian Ruiz ou D\\u00e9sir\\u00e9 Dou\\u00e9? La composition probable de Paris pour la demi-finale retour \\u00e0 Munich\", \"keywords\": [\"finale\", \"aller\", \"mais\", \"ligue\", \"avant\"], \"importance_score\": 70, \"credibility\": 1.0, \"langue\": \"fr\", \"image_url\": \"https://images.bfmtv.com/X_K6nBDr_y2YOhRFkVMQiPQVuD8=/0x14:2048x1166/images/Antoine-Griezmann-lors-d-Arsenal-Atletico-le-5-mai-2026-2281384.jpg\"}, {\"id\": \"d668d703-41a9-4ee9-9a70-225898a94641\", \"title\": \"Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid\", \"url\": \"https://rmcsport.bfmtv.com/football/liga/atletico-de-madrid_DN-202406110400.html\", \"source\": \"RMC Sport\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Football\", \"summary\": \"\\u00c0 l\'emirates stadium \\u00e0 zubieta.on.fr/international/./.\", \"full_content\": \"Apr\\u00e8s le match nul lors de la demi-finale aller la semaine derni\\u00e8re en Espagne (1-1), Arsenal et l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid se retrouvent ce mardi \\u00e0 l\'Emirates Stadium pour se disputer une place en finale de la Ligue des champions. L\\u2019ancien milieu de terrain madril\\u00e8ne Toni Kroos a suivi de pr\\u00e8s la double confrontation entre le FC Barcelone et l\\u2019Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid. Sur la cha\\u00eene YouTube de son fr\\u00e8re \\\"Luppen TV\\\", il a rappel\\u00e9 que les lacunes d\\u00e9fensives des Catalans ont co\\u00fbt\\u00e9 cher aux Barcelonais qui avaient selon lui \\\"la meilleure \\u00e9quipe\\\". Luki Iriarte est au c\\u0153ur de la Real Sociedad depuis 1999. Directeur du centre de formation depuis 2015, il a \\u00e9t\\u00e9 l\\u2019un des artisans du recrutement et de l\\u2019\\u00e9closion d\\u2019Antoine Griezmann \\u00e0 Zubieta, qu\\u2019il a personnellement entra\\u00een\\u00e9 pendant deux ans. Il s\\u2019est confi\\u00e9 \\u00e0 RMC Sport avant une finale de Copa del Rey pas comme les autres: ce samedi soir, Griezmann retrouvera le club qui lui a fait confiance. En critiquant violemment l\\u2019arbitrage de Cl\\u00e9ment Turpin apr\\u00e8s le quart de finale retour de Ligue des champions entre l\\u2019Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid et le FC Barcelone, mardi au Riyadh Air Metropolitano (1-2), Raphinha encourt une sanction de la part de l\\u2019UEFA. l\'ailier br\\u00e9silien du Bar\\u00e7a pourrait \\u00e9coper de plusieurs matchs de suspension. Ancien d\\u00e9fenseur du FC Barcelone, Samuel Umtiti a partag\\u00e9 sa d\\u00e9ception dans l\\u2019After Foot sur RMC au sujet de la prestation d\\u00e9fensive des Baulgrana apr\\u00e8s leur \\u00e9limination en quarts de finale de la Ligue des champions face \\u00e0 l\\u2019Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid. Sans ces erreurs, le Bar\\u00e7a aurait largement pu remporter la double confrontation, d\'apr\\u00e8s lui. Une semaine apr\\u00e8s avoir d\\u00e9j\\u00e0 fait les \\u00e9loges d\'Antoine Griezmann, Diego Simeone a qualifi\\u00e9 son num\\u00e9ro 7 de \\\"g\\u00e9nie du football\\\" dans la foul\\u00e9e de sa tr\\u00e8s bonne peformance lors du quart de finale retour contre le FC Barcelone, qui a vu la qualification de l\'Atletico de Madrid mardi devant son public. La qualification de l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid pour les demi-finales de la Ligue des champions, malgr\\u00e9 la d\\u00e9faite contre le FC Barcelone mardi soir (1-2, 3-2 en cumul\\u00e9), a d\\u00e9bouch\\u00e9 sur des trolls de part et d\'autre, de Diego Simeone \\u00e0 Raphinha en passant par le community manager du compte X des Colchoneros. Alors que le FC Barcelone se plaint de l\'arbitrage de son quart de finale retour de Ligue des champions qui a vu l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid se qualifier, mardi au Riyadh Air Metropolitano, l\'ancien arbitre Mateu Lahoz a salu\\u00e9 la d\\u00e9cision de Cl\\u00e9ment Turpin d\'exclure Eric Garcia en fin de match. Apr\\u00e8s la qualification de l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid contre le FC Barcelone, mardi soir en quart de finale de Ligue des champions, Thierry Henry a rendu un hommage public \\u00e0 Antoine Griezmann sur le plateau de CBS. Apr\\u00e8s l\'\\u00e9limination du FC Barcelone contre l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid, mardi soir, Raphinha et un ancien dirigeant du Bar\\u00e7a ont pris la parole, en zone mixte ou sur les r\\u00e9seaux sociaux, pour parler de l\'arbitrage et qualifier le r\\u00e9sultat d\'un \\\"vol\\\". Dans un match emballant, l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid s\'est retrouv\\u00e9 men\\u00e9 2-0 et tout \\u00e9tait \\u00e0 refaire apr\\u00e8s le match aller. Mais Ademola Lookman a r\\u00e9duit l\'\\u00e9cart et les Colchoneros ont tenu, ensuite, face \\u00e0 un Bar\\u00e7a r\\u00e9duit \\u00e0 10 en fin de match. Les hommes de Diego Simeone rejoignent les demi-finales de Ligue des champions, en attendant Arsenal ou le Sporting. Avant le quart de finale retour de Ligue des champions ce mardi entre l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid et le FC Barcelone, les supporters des Colchoneros ont accueilli les joueurs sous un incroyable arsenal de fumig\\u00e8nes. Alors que le FC Barcelone s\'est plaint de l\'\\u00e9tat de la pelouse madril\\u00e8ne avant le quart de finale retour de Ligue des champions ce mardi (21h), le pr\\u00e9sident de l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid a tenu \\u00e0 mettre les choses au clair: l\'UEFA a valid\\u00e9 le terrain. L\'UEFA a rejet\\u00e9 la plainte du FC Barcelone qui protestait contre un penalty non siffl\\u00e9 en sa faveur contre l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid (0-2), mercredi dernier en quart de finale aller de la Ligue des champions, quand le d\\u00e9fenseur Marc Pubill s\'\\u00e9tait saisi du ballon \\u00e0 la main pour tirer un six m\\u00e8tres. Alors que l\'\\u00e9tat de la pelouse du Metropolitano fait parler avant le quart de finale retour de la Ligue des champions entre l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid et le Bar\\u00e7a ce mardi (21h), l\'UEFA a assur\\u00e9 aux Catalans que la situation \\u00e9tait surveill\\u00e9e. Selon le r\\u00e8glement, la hauteur de la pelouse ne doit pas d\\u00e9passer les 30mm. Lamine Yamal \\u00e9tait de passage en conf\\u00e9rence de presse lundi avant le match retour de Ligue des champions entre l\'Atl\\u00e9tico Madrid et le Bar\\u00e7a, pr\\u00e9vu mardi soir au Metropolitano. Interrog\\u00e9 sur Neymar et LeBron James, la star du Bar\\u00e7a a r\\u00e9affirm\\u00e9 que les deux joueurs \\u00e9taient des sources d\'inspiration pour lui pour tenter de r\\u00e9aliser une remontada contre les Colchoneros. L\\u2019Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid a sign\\u00e9 une victoire importante contre Barcelone (2-0) ce mercredi lors du quart de finale aller de la Ligue des champions disput\\u00e9 au Camp Nou. Les Colchoneros ont ensuite publi\\u00e9 une photo des vitres de leur car apr\\u00e8s un caillassage en marge\", \"keywords\": [\"madrid\", \"atl\\u00e9tico\", \"finale\", \"ligue\", \"champions\"], \"importance_score\": 70, \"credibility\": 1.0, \"langue\": \"fr\", \"image_url\": \"https://images.bfmtv.com/QNhsM9Pgawy8yWkYmZLhwhlGCYQ=/482x71:1874x854/images/Antoine-Griezmann-avec-l-Atletico-de-Madrid-face-au-Borussia-Dortmund-en-Ligue-des-champions-le-10-avril-2024-1845369.jpg\"}, {\"id\": \"8fea0147-2849-40a7-8529-b8224d0ce550\", \"title\": \"Antoine Griezmann\", \"url\": \"https://rmcsport.bfmtv.com/football/antoine-griezmann_DN-202108310489.html\", \"source\": \"RMC Sport\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Football\", \"summary\": \"Simeone a r\\u00e9p\\u00e9t\\u00e9 son envie de faire \\\"quelque chose d\'incroyable\\\" \\u00e0 35 ans.\", \"full_content\": \"Pass\\u00e9 en conf\\u00e9rence de presse \\u00e0 la veille de la demi-finale retour de Ligue des champions entre Arsenal et l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid (1-1 \\u00e0 l\'aller), Antoine Griezmann a r\\u00e9p\\u00e9t\\u00e9 son envie de faire \\\"quelque chose d\'incroyable\\\", et de soulever enfin la coupe aux grandes oreilles, dix ans apr\\u00e8s la finale perdue contre le Real. \\u00c0 la veille du quart de finale aller de Ligue des champions face au FC Barcelone (mercredi, 21 heures), l\'entra\\u00eeneur de l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid Diego Simeone s\'est lanc\\u00e9 dans une d\\u00e9claration d\'amour pour Antoine Griezmann. L\'avertissant toutefois qu\'il devra \\\"courir\\\" pour garder sa place. A 35 ans, Antoine Griezmann va d\\u00e9barquer en Major League Soccer comme il en r\\u00eavait depuis longtemps pour la fin de sa carri\\u00e8re. En juin prochain, il sera un joueur de la franchise floridienne d\\u2019Orlando City. N\\u00e9anmoins, ce choix interroge les sp\\u00e9cialistes du championnat nord-am\\u00e9ricain, dans une ville \\\"ins\\u00e9cure\\\", loin du glamour de New York ou Miami et surtout dans une \\u00e9quipe du bas de tableau de MLS. Un mariage \\\"qui sent le fiasco\\\" m\\u00eame si l\\u2019arriv\\u00e9e d\\u2019un champion du monde reste un \\u00e9v\\u00e9nement pour les passionn\\u00e9s de soccer. Apr\\u00e8s plusieurs semaines d\'attente, Orlando a annonc\\u00e9 ce mardi la future arriv\\u00e9e d\'Antoine Griezmann en MLS. L\'attaquant fran\\u00e7ais quittera l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid \\u00e0 la fin de la saison 2025-2026 et rejoindra la ligue nord-am\\u00e9ricaine pendant l\'\\u00e9t\\u00e9. Antoine Griezmann va bel et bien rejoindre la MLS en s\'engageant cet \\u00e9t\\u00e9 avec Orlando. Et les conditions de son arriv\\u00e9e commencent \\u00e0 se d\\u00e9voiler. Antoine Griezmann va profiter de la tr\\u00eave internationale pour aller finaliser son transfert avec Orlando City, club de MLS, qu\'il devrait rejoindre d\\u00e8s cet \\u00e9t\\u00e9, ont r\\u00e9v\\u00e9l\\u00e9 ce lundi plusieurs titres de presse espagnols et fran\\u00e7ais. Le Journal de Mickey a r\\u00e9alis\\u00e9, avec l\\u2019institut OpinionWay, une grande enqu\\u00eate aupr\\u00e8s des 7-14 ans pour conna\\u00eetre leurs personnalit\\u00e9s francophones favorites. Six sportifs sont pr\\u00e9sents dans le Top 10 dont Giroud et Wembanyama sur le podium. Encore buteur mardi soir en Ligue des champions, Antoine Griezmann conserve une forme \\u00e9tincelante au plus haut niveau. De quoi rendre nostalgique Eric Di Meco. Tr\\u00e8s bon avec l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid lors de la victoire contre Tottenham (5-2) en Ligue des champions ce mardi soir, Antoine Griezmann a eu des mots sympathiques apr\\u00e8s la rencontre pour Antonin Kinsky, le malheureux gardien des Spurs coupable de deux boulettes et remplac\\u00e9 d\\u00e8s la 17e. Pour l\'attaquant fran\\u00e7ais, Igor Tudor aurait d\\u00fb faire confiance au portier tch\\u00e8que jusqu\'au bout. Apr\\u00e8s avoir sorti le Club Bruges lors des barrages, l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid d\'Antoine Griezmann recevait un Tottenham mal en point au Riyadh Air Metropolitano, ce mardi en huiti\\u00e8mes de finale de la Ligue des champions. Et les Colchoneros ont corrig\\u00e9 les Spurs, en profitant de grosses erreurs individuelles des Londoniens lors du premier acte (5-2). Diego Simeone et ses hommes ont fait un grand pas vers la qualification. Annonc\\u00e9 sur le d\\u00e9part depuis quelques semaines en direction d\\u2019Orlando City en MLS, Antoine Griezmann va finalement rester \\u00e0 l\\u2019Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid jusqu\\u2019\\u00e0 la fin de la saison avant de nouvelles opportunit\\u00e9s l\\u2019\\u00e9t\\u00e9 prochain, selon L\\u2019Equipe. L\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid s\'est qualifi\\u00e9 pour la finale de Coupe du Roi ce mardi malgr\\u00e9 une d\\u00e9faite face au FC Barcelone (3-0). Sur ses r\\u00e9seaux sociaux, Antoine Griezmann a chambr\\u00e9 les Catalans, sous forme d\'une r\\u00e9ponse \\u00e0 une ancienne pique de son ancien club. Annonc\\u00e9 avec insistance du c\\u00f4t\\u00e9 de la MLS et de la franchise d\'Orlando avant la fin de saison, Antoine Griezmann reste un joueur de l\'Atletico de Madrid. Sa direction et Diego Simeone ont fait preuve de fermet\\u00e9 au moment de s\'exprimer vendredi sur l\'avenir de l\'attaquant. Antoine Griezmann est en discussions avec le Orlando City Soccer Club, du championnat nord-am\\u00e9ricain MLS, a indiqu\\u00e9 lundi \\u00e0 l\'AFP une source proche des n\\u00e9gociations. Samuel Umtiti a interview\\u00e9 Antoine Griezmann apr\\u00e8s la large victoire de l\\u2019Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid face au FC Barcelone (4-0) en Coupe du roi. Deux anciens joueurs blaugrana, champions du monde 2018, qui ont offert une belle s\\u00e9quence de complicit\\u00e9 et de nostalgie. L\\u2019ancien international fran\\u00e7ais souffre d\\u2019une \\u201cl\\u00e9sion musculaire de faible gravit\\u00e9 \\u00e0 la cuisse gauche\\u201d, a annonc\\u00e9 l\\u2019Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid dans un communiqu\\u00e9, ce vendredi 23 janvier. Il devrait \\u00eatre au moins indisponible pour le match de Liga contre Majorque, ce dimanche. Antoine Griezmann a qualifi\\u00e9 l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid (0-1) pour les quarts de finale de la Coupe d\'Espagne en inscrivant un superbe coup franc, mardi contre la Corogne (0-1), \\u00e9quipe de D2 espagnole. \\u00c2g\\u00e9 de 12 ans, I\\u00f1igo Asorey est gardien dans les \\u00e9quipes de jeunes de l\'Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid. Il a r\\u00e9cemment fait parler de lui en Espagne pour avoir \\u00e9t\\u00e9 \\u00e9tincelant lors de LaLiga FC Futures. Un tournoi o\\u00f9 il a aussi marqu\\u00e9 un but sur un d\\u00e9gagement de sa propre surface. Mais l\'Atl\\u00e9tico, qui a instaur\\u00e9 une taille r\\u00e9glementaire pour ses gardiens de but, pourrait s\'en s\\u00e9parer prochainemen\", \"keywords\": [\"antoine\", \"griezmann\", \"atl\\u00e9tico\", \"madrid\", \"orlando\"], \"importance_score\": 65, \"credibility\": 1.0, \"langue\": \"fr\", \"image_url\": \"https://images.bfmtv.com/MA4CC1kCU1dF4TNoCFIUq80koQg=/0x39:768x471/images/L-attaquant-francais-Antoine-Griezmann-lors-du-match-entre-son-equipe-del-Atletico-Madrid-et-le-Betis-Seville-le-31-octobre-a-Madirid-1157787.jpg\"}, {\"id\": \"60205776-a792-4f7e-b5f5-ce38e89f40f0\", \"title\": \"Arsenal reaches its first Champions League final in 20 years as Saka\\u2019s goal seals win over Atletico\", \"url\": \"https://apnews.com/article/arsenal-atletico-champions-league-semifinal-052bec201214e80c6a3c0b22f4d80227\", \"source\": \"AP Sports\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Football\", \"summary\": \": arsenal\\u2019s manager mikel arteta celebrates with a goal at the english premier league semifinal, second leg,.\", \"full_content\": \"Arsenal\\u2019s Bukayo Saka celebrates after scoring his side\\u2019s second goal during the English Premier League soccer match between Arsenal and Fulham in London, England, Saturday, May 2, 2026. (AP Photo/Kin Cheung) Arsenal\\u2019s Bukayo Saka celebrates after scoring the opening goal during a Champions League semifinal, second leg, soccer match between Arsenal FC and Atletico Madrid in London, Tuesday, May 5, 2026. (AP Photo/Alastair Grant) Giuliano Simeone del Atl\\u00e9tico de Madrid intenta rematar a gol ante Arsenal en la vuelta de la semifinal de la Liga de Campeones, el martes 5 de mayo de 2026, en Londres. (AP Foto/Alastair Grant) Arsenal\\u2019s Declan Rice drives the ball past Atletico Madrid\\u2019s Antoine Griezmann, left, during a Champions League semifinal, second leg, soccer match between Arsenal FC and Atletico Madrid in London, Tuesday, May 5, 2026. (AP Photo/Alastair Grant) Arsenal\\u2019s manager Mikel Arteta celebrates with Arsenal\\u2019s William Saliba at the the end of a Champions League semifinal, second leg, soccer match between Arsenal FC and Atletico Madrid in London, Tuesday, May 5, 2026. (AP Photo/Alastair Grant) LONDON (AP) \\u2014 The last time Arsenal played in the Champions League final, Bukayo Saka was still four years away from joining the club\\u2019s academy. Now Saka, the winger who first signed for Arsenal at age 8, has put his club back onto the biggest stage. Saka scored the only goal in a 1-0 win over Atletico Madrid on Tuesday to put Arsenal into its first Champions League final since 2006 \\u2014 and only its second ever. No wonder he was reluctant to stop celebrating with the crowd and his teammates after the final whistle and do a TV interview on the field instead. \\u201cYou\\u2019re taking me away from the celebrations, man,\\u201d Saka told Amazon Prime with a laugh. \\u201cIt is so beautiful. You see what it means to us and what it means to the fans. We\\u2019re so happy.\\u201d The 24-year-old Saka was on hand to slot in the rebound after Leandro Trossard\\u2019s shot was saved by Jan Oblak in the 45th minute to put Arsenal up 2-1 on aggregate in the second leg of their semifinal. Arsenal has now kept a clean sheet at home in all three knockout rounds after conceding a competition-low four goals in winning all eight of its matches in the league phase. It will be Arsenal\\u2019s second final in Europe\\u2019s premier competition, having lost the 2006 title match to Barcelona. This time it will face either defending champion Paris Saint-Germain or Bayern Munich in Budapest, Hungary, on May 30. PSG won the pulsating first leg of their semifinal 5-4, and the second leg is in Munich on Wednesday. It could prove a special season for the London cub, which is now one game away from its first European Cup title and three games away from a first Premier League crown in 22 years. The Gunners are guaranteed the domestic league title if they win their remaining three matches, after closest rival Manchester City was held to a 3-3 draw at Everton on Monday. \\u201cNow we are in the final of the Champions League and we\\u2019re fighting for the Premier League,\\u201d Saka said. \\u201cIt\\u2019s a beautiful a story and I hope it ends well in Budapest.\\u201d His fellow academy product Myles Lewis-Skelly hadn\\u2019t even been born in 2006, but the 19-year-old again looked assured in midfield after being handed a surprise start by Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta. Atletico had a chance to equalize in the 51st when Giuliano Simeone chased down a poor backward header from William Saliba to round goalkeeper David Raya, but center back Gabriel did just enough to make him put his effort wide. Atletico was then denied a possible penalty when Arsenal defender Riccardo Calafiori stepped on the foot of Antoine Griezmann in the area, as referee Daniel Siebert awarded a free kick to the hosts for an earlier incident instead. Atletico coach Diego Simeone, clad in his customary all-black attire, grew increasingly agitated on the sidelines as the decisions went against his club and the search for an equalizer proved fruitless. He was eventually booked for his remonstrations in stoppage time. Simeone led his team to the Champions League final in 2014 and 2016, losing both times to Real Madrid, but will have to wait for a third chance to deliver the club\\u2019s first European Cup. \\u201cIt hurts a lot but I\\u2019m proud of my team and my fans,\\u201d Atletico midfielder Koke Resurrecci\\u00f3n said. \\u201cWe gave it all. We had our chances to score but the ball didn\\u2019t want to go in, just like in the first match. They were more effective than us and deserved to advance.\\u201d Arsenal striker Viktor Gy\\u00f6keres had a great chance to double the lead on a counterattack in the 66th when Piero Hincapie picked him out with a cross but he side footed his effort over the bar. As expected, though, this matchup never looked likely to descend into the kind of free-flowing back-and-forth attacking play of the PSG-Bayern game, as Arsenal\\u2019s defense held firm. Whichever team wins that second semifinal, the final in Budapest promises to be a contrast in styles.\", \"keywords\": [\"arsenal\", \"league\", \"second\", \"atletico\", \"saka\"], \"importance_score\": 35, \"credibility\": 0.5, \"langue\": \"en\", \"image_url\": \"https://dims.apnews.com/dims4/default/ef11a40/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4654x3101+0+1/resize/980x653!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.apnews.com%2F53%2F65%2Ff3e5a0b580002a2fd2a739c85490%2F9d66896594c0406ba490aec0f696dabb\"}, {\"id\": \"09d6f416-4f62-4f62-89ee-a64a5b116e4f\", \"title\": \"Saka downs Atletico to send Arsenal into Champions League final\", \"url\": \"https://www.skysports.com/football/arsenal-vs-atletico-madrid/report/554949\", \"source\": \"Sky Sports\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Football\", \"summary\": \"Arsenal vs atletico madrid. Uefa champions league semi-final.\", \"full_content\": \"Arsenal vs Atletico Madrid. UEFA Champions League Semi-Final. Report as Bukayo Saka\'s goal seals a 2-1 aggregate victory over Atletico Madrid to send Arsenal into the Champions League final; Gunners will face either Bayern Munich or Paris Saint-Germain in Budapest on May 30 as they bid to lift the trophy for the first time Arsenal reached the Champions League final for the first time in 20 years as Bukayo Saka\'s goal clinched a 1-0 win over Atletico Madrid at the Emirates Stadium to complete a 2-1 aggregate victory. On a momentous night for the club, Saka turned home the decisive goal just before half-time after Leandro Trossard\'s shot had been parried by Jan Oblak, ensuring that Arsenal will face either Bayern Munich or Paris Saint-Germain in Budapest on May 30. The Gunners, aiming to lift the trophy for the first time in their history having been beaten by Barcelona in their only previous final appearance in 2006, were deserving winners but had to come through another fiercely-contested encounter with Atletico. Arsenal: Raya (8), White (7), Saliba (8), Gabriel (8), Calafiori (7), Lewis-Skelly (7), Rice (9), Eze (7), Saka (8), Gyokeres (8), Trossard (7) Subs: Madueke (6), Hincapie (7), Odegaard (6), Zubimendi (6), Martinelli (6) Atletico Madrid: Oblak (6), Pubill (6), Hancko (6), Le Normand (6), Ruggeri (6), Simeone (6), Koke (6), Llorente (6), Lookman (6), Alvarez (6), Griezmann (6) Subs: Sorloth (6), Molina (6), Cardoso (6), Baena (6), Almada (6) Player of the Match: Declan Rice It might have turned out differently had the excellent Declan Rice not made a vital tackle to prevent a certain goal from Giuliano Simeone in the first half. There was another goal-saving challenge on the same Atletico player by Gabriel Magalhaes after half-time. But Arsenal, dogged in claiming a draw in last week\'s first leg, produced another outstanding defensive display to limit Atletico\'s chances, clinching a ninth clean sheet in 14 European games and a 30th in all competitions this season. They also missed chances to kill the tie at the other end of the pitch. The tireless Viktor Gyokeres spurned the best of them, firing over the crossbar from substitute Piero Hincapie\'s low cross when well placed to score in the centre of the box. In the end, though, Saka\'s goal proved sufficient, as Arsenal saw out the closing stages in relative comfort before jubilant scenes of celebration which included manager Mikel Arteta sprinting onto the pitch to join his players after the final whistle. Arsenal will now switch their focus back to the Premier League title race, with West Ham next up on Super Sunday, knowing they will have the chance to finish an epic campaign on an unprecedented high in Budapest at the end of May. Arsenal will turn their attention back to the Premier League title race as they take on relegation-threatened West Ham on Sunday May 10, live on Sky Sports with kick-off at 4.30pm. The 2026 Champions League final takes place on Saturday May 30 at the 67,000-capacity Puskas Arena in Budapest, Hungary. Kick-off is 5pm BST.\", \"keywords\": [\"arsenal\", \"atletico\", \"league\", \"final\", \"goal\"], \"importance_score\": 30, \"credibility\": 1.0, \"langue\": \"en\", \"image_url\": \"https://e0.365dm.com/26/05/1600x900/skysports-saka-arsenal-champions-league_7240065.jpg?20260505205619\"}, {\"id\": \"bd58106d-30fc-42aa-8e65-2833801d6eda\", \"title\": \"Saka downs Atletico to send Arsenal into Champions League final\", \"url\": \"https://www.skysports.com/football/arsenal-vs-atletico-madrid/report/554949\", \"source\": \"Sky Sports Arsenal\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Football\", \"summary\": \"Arsenal vs atletico madrid. Uefa champions league semi-final.\", \"full_content\": \"Arsenal vs Atletico Madrid. UEFA Champions League Semi-Final. Report as Bukayo Saka\'s goal seals a 2-1 aggregate victory over Atletico Madrid to send Arsenal into the Champions League final; Gunners will face either Bayern Munich or Paris Saint-Germain in Budapest on May 30 as they bid to lift the trophy for the first time Arsenal reached the Champions League final for the first time in 20 years as Bukayo Saka\'s goal clinched a 1-0 win over Atletico Madrid at the Emirates Stadium to complete a 2-1 aggregate victory. On a momentous night for the club, Saka turned home the decisive goal just before half-time after Leandro Trossard\'s shot had been parried by Jan Oblak, ensuring that Arsenal will face either Bayern Munich or Paris Saint-Germain in Budapest on May 30. The Gunners, aiming to lift the trophy for the first time in their history having been beaten by Barcelona in their only previous final appearance in 2006, were deserving winners but had to come through another fiercely-contested encounter with Atletico. Arsenal: Raya (8), White (7), Saliba (8), Gabriel (8), Calafiori (7), Lewis-Skelly (7), Rice (9), Eze (7), Saka (8), Gyokeres (8), Trossard (7) Subs: Madueke (6), Hincapie (7), Odegaard (6), Zubimendi (6), Martinelli (6) Atletico Madrid: Oblak (6), Pubill (6), Hancko (6), Le Normand (6), Ruggeri (6), Simeone (6), Koke (6), Llorente (6), Lookman (6), Alvarez (6), Griezmann (6) Subs: Sorloth (6), Molina (6), Cardoso (6), Baena (6), Almada (6) Player of the Match: Declan Rice It might have turned out differently had the excellent Declan Rice not made a vital tackle to prevent a certain goal from Giuliano Simeone in the first half. There was another goal-saving challenge on the same Atletico player by Gabriel Magalhaes after half-time. But Arsenal, dogged in claiming a draw in last week\'s first leg, produced another outstanding defensive display to limit Atletico\'s chances, clinching a ninth clean sheet in 14 European games and a 30th in all competitions this season. They also missed chances to kill the tie at the other end of the pitch. The tireless Viktor Gyokeres spurned the best of them, firing over the crossbar from substitute Piero Hincapie\'s low cross when well placed to score in the centre of the box. In the end, though, Saka\'s goal proved sufficient, as Arsenal saw out the closing stages in relative comfort before jubilant scenes of celebration which included manager Mikel Arteta sprinting onto the pitch to join his players after the final whistle. Arsenal will now switch their focus back to the Premier League title race, with West Ham next up on Super Sunday, knowing they will have the chance to finish an epic campaign on an unprecedented high in Budapest at the end of May. Arsenal will turn their attention back to the Premier League title race as they take on relegation-threatened West Ham on Sunday May 10, live on Sky Sports with kick-off at 4.30pm. The 2026 Champions League final takes place on Saturday May 30 at the 67,000-capacity Puskas Arena in Budapest, Hungary. Kick-off is 5pm BST.\", \"keywords\": [\"arsenal\", \"atletico\", \"league\", \"final\", \"goal\"], \"importance_score\": 30, \"credibility\": 1.0, \"langue\": \"en\", \"image_url\": \"https://e0.365dm.com/26/05/1600x900/skysports-saka-arsenal-champions-league_7240065.jpg?20260505205619\"}, {\"id\": \"08efddf0-e8ea-4bc4-a31c-84e35751a860\", \"title\": \"MVG dumped out as \'breakthrough talent\' Nijman maintains ProTour supremacy\", \"url\": \"https://www.skysports.com/darts/news/12040/13540525/michael-van-gerwens-search-for-a-first-pdc-protour-of-the-season-continues-as-wessel-nijman-continues-his-domination\", \"source\": \"Sky Sports\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Football\", \"summary\": \": michael van gerwen still searching for a first pdc protour of the season continues as wessel nijman becomes the first player.\", \"full_content\": \"Michael van Gerwen still searching for a first PDC ProTour of the season continues as Wessel Nijman becomes the first player since his compatriot Van Gerwen in 2016 to win five titles in a year; you can watch Premier League Darts live on Sky Sports every Thursday Michael van Gerwen\'s search for a first PDC ProTour win of the season continues after he was dumped out of the Players Championship 14 in Hildesheim in the third round. The Dutch three-time world champion lost 6-4 to Austria\'s Mensur Suljovic, who capitalised on taking a 4-1 lead to advance into the last 16 before losing to Tom Bissell in the quarter-finals. Wessel Nijman became the first player since his compatriot Van Gerwen in 2016 to win five titles in a year after he crushed Max Hopp 8-1 in the final. The Dutchman punished Hopp busting 61 to lead 1-0, before taking an 88 checkout to double his advantage. The 25-year-old then won another four legs straight to lead 6-0, including an 84 outshot on the bullseye and whopping 140 checkout in legs five and six respectively, averaging north of 110 two legs from victory. Although Hopp broke in the seventh leg, it proved a mere consolation for the German, as Nijman broke back before sealing the title with a 15-dart hold. \\\"It\'s always good to hold your best game for the final, professed Nijman, who produced his best performance of the day against Hopp with a 104.62 average. \\\"I\'m just happy with the way I\'m playing. I played well today, especially in the later stages of the tournament. \\\"I\'m feeling pretty confident in these floor events, and I hope I can play like this on the floor for many more years. \\\"I don\'t really care about records, I care more about the form that I\'m playing right now. It\'s always good to have those kinds of records in your bag, but it doesn\'t give you much more than the form you\'re in. \\\"I just want to be in the top 16 and make as many steps as close to number one as possible by the end of the year.\\\" The Dutchman kicked off the event with comfortable wins over Daniel Klose and Jurjen van der Velde, followed by a 6-3 win over Niall Culleton to reach the last 16. The 25-year-old faced his closest match of the day against Joe Cullen at this stage, triumphing 6-4 with a stellar 102 average - the first of four consecutive ton-plus averages before clinching the title. Nijman then thumped Krzysztof Ratajski 6-1 with a 102.98 average, before breezing past Danny Noppert 7-2 to reach a remarkable sixth final on the floor this year in just 12 attempts. Hopp, on the other hand, entered the top ten of the Players Championship rankings after making his first final since 2019. Speaking on the latest episode of the Love The Darts podcast, Matt Edgar, said: \\\"We sat her in November looking ahead to the world championship and I said Nijman is about to make lifestyle changes and keep an eye on him. \\\"Those lifestyle changes have been made. He\'s now committed to darts on full-time basis. He\'s stepped away from the job and he\'s in a very, very good position away from the oche and that\'s 90 per cent of the battle. \\\"He\'s got that absolutely nailed now. I thought he would step it up but I didn\'t think he would step it up to the level he has now. I can\'t see him doing anything but transferring it now to the main stages. He\'s working very, very hard off the oche. He\'s going to be a breakthrough talent.\\\" The 2026 PDC ProTour season continues next week with another Players Championship double-header, Events 15-16 will be played out in Leicester on May 11-12. 2026 Players Championship FourteenTuesday May 5Halle 39, HildesheimLast 16Wessel Nijman 6-4 Joe CullenKrzysztof Ratajski 6-1 James HurrellDanny Noppert 6-2 Dirk van DuijvenbodeRichard Veenstra 6-1 Oliver MitchellTom Bissell 6-1 Lukas WenigMensur Suljovic 6-3 Maik KuivenhovenJoe Hunt 6-1 Keane BarryMax Hopp 6-2 Rob Cross Quarter-FinalsWessel Nijman 6-1 Krzysztof RatajskiDanny Noppert 6-2 Richard VeenstraTom Bissell 6-5 Mensur SuljovicMax Hopp 6-3 Joe Hunt The 2026 BetMGM Premier League season continues in Leeds, as Humphries targets a third consecutive triumph at the First Direct Arena. The reigning champion takes on Josh Rock in his quarter-final tie, as league leader Luke Littler begins his latest nightly bid against Van Gerwen. Gerwyn Price and Jonny Clayton go head-to-head in an all-Welsh affair in next week\'s opener, while Gian van Veen and Stephen Bunting also do battle for a place in the semi-finals. Ranking points are awarded per night - with five to the winner, three to the runner-up and two to the semi-finalists - to form the league table from which the top four players will progress to Finals Night at The O2 in London on Thursday May 28. Who will win this year\'s Premier League Darts? Luke Humphries will be defending his title and you can watch the action every single Thursday until May on Sky Sports. Stream darts and more top sport with NOW.\", \"keywords\": [\"with\", \"nijman\", \"first\", \"year\", \"hopp\"], \"importance_score\": 25, \"credibility\": 1.0, \"langue\": \"en\", \"image_url\": \"https://e0.365dm.com/26/02/1600x900/skysports-michael-van-gerwen_7163552.jpg?20260307072116\"}, {\"id\": \"44e15418-8818-4fbe-94e4-9990dfdf10ca\", \"title\": \"Carra: If Arsenal beat West Ham, they win the Premier League\", \"url\": \"https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11670/13540221/everton-3-3-man-city-if-arsenal-beat-west-ham-on-sunday-they-win-the-premier-league-title-says-jamie-carragher\", \"source\": \"Sky Sports Arsenal\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Football\", \"summary\": \"On sunday live on sky sports from 4pm; kick-off 4.30pm if arsenal beat west ham in the premier league this weekend.\", \"full_content\": \"Man City rescued a late 3-3 draw at Everton, missing the chance to close the gap on Arsenal to three points; the Gunners travel to the London Stadium in the Premier League this weekend; watch West Ham vs Arsenal on Sunday live on Sky Sports from 4pm; kick-off 4.30pm If Arsenal beat West Ham at the London Stadium on Sunday, live on Sky Sports, they will win the Premier League title, says Jamie Carragher. The assessment came after their title rivals, Manchester City, rescued a late 3-3 draw against Everton on Monday Night Football. It means Arsenal retain a five-point gap at the top of the table with three games - four for Pep Guardiola\'s side - to play. Put simply, the Gunners need to win all three of those matches to secure their first Premier League title in 22 years. Their next game is a trip to the London Stadium on Super Sunday - and they might go into it as Champions League finalists, playing their second leg against Atletico Madrid at the Emirates on Tuesday. Sky Sports pundit Carragher believes if Arsenal win in east London, that will be the title race wrapped up, telling Monday Night Football: \\\"From an Arsenal perspective, tonight is about the league. \\\"But can you imagine the stadium tomorrow [against Atletico]? The excitement for the competition, the energy from the fans that will be in that stadium - to get to a Champions League final and the league is in your hands with three games to go. But former Gunners striker Thierry Henry warned that West Ham could be Arsenal\'s Everton and give this title race another dramatic twist. \\\"I said earlier that I could see City dropping points against Everton and that I\'m worried about the West Ham game. \\\"So I\'m going to stay in my lane and not celebrate too early because nothing is done, but I could see that happening. \\\"I saw a bit of nervousness with City because they imploded. They brought Everton back into the game with some mistakes. \\\"Arsenal can see that Man City dropped two points, but you can\'t start to think that, \'Now, maybe...\' There\'s no maybe. Win your games. Don\'t look at City. It\'s in your hands.\\\" It was a rollercoaster of emotions for Pep Guardiola on his first visit to the Hill Dickinson Stadium. His side were 1-0 up at the break, but a string of errors saw Everton storm into a 3-1 lead. But an instant reply from Erling Haaland reduced the deficit to one, before a late Jeremy Doku strike secured a point. The Man City boss was upbeat after the game, telling Sky Sports: \\\"Really good performance. We played an outstanding first half. It was so difficult with their physicality. \\\"Second half, they made a step up. We didn\'t have as much control and we gave away the goal. After that they come back and make a proper English game, so aggressive in the duels. \\\"We take the point and until it\'s over, we\'re going to continue. Everton away is always difficult and I give credit to them for their composure and aggression. \\\"It\'s better than a loss. We played to win. It just shows what the team are. We tried and we have done it. It\'s not in our hands. Before it was in our hands. Now, no. \\\"We have to do it in our four games that we have in the Premier League. It will be quite similar against Brentford. We will see what happens.\\\"\", \"keywords\": [\"that\", \"arsenal\", \"league\", \"city\", \"everton\"], \"importance_score\": 25, \"credibility\": 1.0, \"langue\": \"en\", \"image_url\": \"https://e0.365dm.com/26/05/1600x900/skysports-premier-league-arsenal_7237471.jpg?20260502183717\"}, {\"id\": \"5e4b5526-6964-445c-aac7-ed78f7bc18f7\", \"title\": \"Former Patriots receiver Stefon Diggs is found not guilty of assaulting his private chef\", \"url\": \"https://apnews.com/article/patriots-new-england-stefon-diggs-assault-chef-7128f3d02e1058120d0d5423f0ec72f5\", \"source\": \"AP Sports\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Natation\", \"summary\": \"Of assault trial of former new england patriots wide receiver stefon diggs, left, embraces his attorney.\", \"full_content\": \"Former Patriots receiver Stefon Diggs has been found not guilty of assaulting his private chef in a pay dispute. The defense and prosecution deliver closing arguments in the assault trial of former New England Patriots receiver Stefon Diggs after calling multiple witnesses to the stand A woman who worked as a live-in chef for Stefon Diggs and is accusing the former New England Patriots wide receiver of assault is expected to continue testimony at his trial, which is marked by sharply conflicting accounts of what happened inside his home. Former New England Patriots wide receiver Stefon Diggs appears in court during his trial at Norfolk County District Court, Tuesday, May 5, 2026, in Dedham, Mass. (AP Photo/Charles Krupa, Pool) Former New England Patriots wide receiver Stefon Diggs, left, embraces his attorney Mitchell Schuster outside Norfolk County District Court after a not guilty verdict in his trial, Tuesday, May 5, 2026, in Dedham, Mass. (AP Photo/Charles Krupa) Former New England Patriots wide receiver Stefon Diggs, left, is embraced after a not guilty verdict at his trial at Norfolk County District Court, Tuesday, May 5, 2026, in Dedham, Mass. (AP Photo/Charles Krupa, Pool) Witness Jamila Adams testifies during the trial of former New England Patriots wide receiver Stefon Diggs at Norfolk County District Court, Tuesday, May 5, 2026, in Dedham, Mass. (AP Photo/Charles Krupa, Pool) Former New England Patriots wide receiver Stefon Diggs listens to his defense attorney cross examine witness Jamila Adams during his trial at Norfolk County District Court, Tuesday, May 5, 2026, in Dedham, Mass. (AP Photo/Charles Krupa, Pool) Witness Jamila Adams, right, walks past former New England Patriots wide receiver Stefon Diggs during Diggs\\u2019 trial at Norfolk County District Court, Tuesday, May 5, 2026, in Dedham, Mass. (AP Photo/Charles Krupa, Pool) Witness Jamila Adams testifies during the trial of former New England Patriots wide receiver Stefon Diggs at Norfolk County District Court, Tuesday, May 5, 2026, in Dedham, Mass. (AP Photo/Charles Krupa, Pool) BOSTON (AP) \\u2014 Former New England Patriots receiver Stefon Diggs was found not guilty Tuesday of assaulting his personal chef in a case marked by conflicting accounts of what happened inside his home after disputes over money and their relationship. The charges stemmed from a Dec. 2 incident at his house in Dedham, where Jamila Adams, a former live-in personal chef known as Mila, testified that Diggs slapped and choked her during an argument. He had pleaded not guilty to a felony strangulation charge and a misdemeanor assault and battery charge. Diggs\\u2019 attorneys said the alleged assault never happened and challenged Adams\\u2019 credibility, arguing the dispute was about money or relationship tensions \\u2014 including a disagreement over a planned trip to Miami \\u2014 rather than a violent attack. They pointed to financial demands she made and testimony from friends and employees who said she did not appear injured in the days after the encounter, while prosecutors argued the case rests on her account of what happened inside the home. Defense attorney Andrew Kettlewell told jurors during closing arguments that prosecutors had not presented \\u201ca single shred of credible evidence\\u201d that an assault occurred. He said Adams made the accusation to \\u201cleverage and humiliate and to punish\\u201d Diggs. Assistant District Attorney Drew Virtue said Adams\\u2019 behavior should be viewed in the context of her relationship with Diggs, whom he described as \\u201ca sometimes lover, a boss, landlord,\\u201d pointing to the imbalance in that relationship as a factor in how she responded afterward. \\u201cHe was an athlete, a celebrity, financially powerful, surrounded by people that were all on his payroll that liked him,\\u201d Virtue said. \\u201cAnd when you put that all in consideration, her behavior does make sense.\\u201d \\u201cShe was argumentative, avoidant, difficult. But does that mean you should throw away everything she said? No,\\u201d he said, adding that jurors should give her testimony \\u201cthe attention, the scrutiny, the weight it deserves.\\u201d Witness Jamila Adams, right, walks past former New England Patriots wide receiver Stefon Diggs during Diggs\\u2019 trial at Norfolk County District Court, Tuesday, May 5, 2026, in Dedham, Mass. (AP Photo/Charles Krupa, Pool) Earlier in the trial, Adams became emotional on the stand while describing an alleged encounter with Diggs on in which she said he entered her room following an argument over text. Adams, who said she lived in the NFL star\\u2019s home and prepared all of his meals, testified that Diggs \\u201csmacked me with an open hand\\u201d before wrapping his arm around her neck and choking her, leaving her struggling to breathe. She described what she called a \\u201ccomplicated\\u201d relationship, saying it had previously been sexual but was not at the time of the alleged assault. Adams said she met Diggs in 2022 on Instagram and that the two became friends \\u2014 at times \\u201cfriends with benefits,\\u201d as one of his attorneys described it\", \"keywords\": [\"diggs\", \"former\", \"patriots\", \"receiver\", \"stefon\"], \"importance_score\": 15, \"credibility\": 0.5, \"langue\": \"en\", \"image_url\": \"https://dims.apnews.com/dims4/default/c298ac9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5280x3518+488+0/resize/980x653!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.apnews.com%2Ff4%2Fce%2F7791b81d15e7148e6c446fedaf4b%2F9d260ee8e85d43b2aa5ccbf53b5e527d\"}, {\"id\": \"ce8b9e46-86fd-41ac-ab0e-096139fea80a\", \"title\": \"Matthews ruled out of final two matches of Women\'s Six Nations\", \"url\": \"https://www.skysports.com/rugby-union/news/12040/13540478/englands-alex-matthews-ruled-out-of-final-two-matches-of-womens-six-nations-after-suffering-shoulder-damage\", \"source\": \"Sky Sports\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Football\", \"summary\": \"A week later england have been dealt another forward injury blow after no 8 annah botterman and abbie ward.\", \"full_content\": \"Alex Matthews has been ruled out of the final two matches of the Guinness Women\'s Six Nations after suffering shoulder damage sustained in the 33-12 victory over Ireland in round one, preventing her from facing Italy on Saturday or France in the likely title decider a week later England have been dealt another forward injury blow after No 8 Alex Matthews was ruled out of the final two matches of the Women\'s Six Nations. The double World Cup winner is to undergo surgery this week on the shoulder damage sustained in the 33-12 victory over Ireland in round one, preventing her from facing Italy on Saturday or France in the likely title decider a week later. Lilli Ives Campion and Sadia Kabeya are continuing their rehab in camp in the hope of being available for the visit to Bordeaux on May 17, while Hannah Botterman and Morwenna Talling are also in the treatment room. Furthermore, Zoe Stratford, Abbie Ward, Lark Atkin-Davies and Rosie Galligan are missing due to pregnancy. The absences have not halted England\'s charge through the tournament with their 62-24 victory over Wales in round three a 36th successive win. Ellie Kildunne returns to the left wing against Italy in Parma with Emma Sing restored at full-back and Mia Venner appearing on the right wing for her fourth cap. Zoe Harrison replaces Holly Aitchison at fly-half. Australian-born Haidee Head is set to make her debut after being named on the bench as back row cover, while rookie Bristol duo Delaney Burns and Demelza Short continue in the back row. \\\"We\'ve built momentum throughout this tournament by stacking strong moments together and that will be crucial again this weekend,\\\" head coach John Mitchell said. \\\"Italy will be full of confidence after their result against Scotland (winning 41-14) and they\'ll challenge us in different ways. \\\"For us, it\'s about staying locked in on our key actions - applying pressure and intentionally attacking the space with speed. England: E Sing (Gloucester-Hartpury); M Venner (Gloucester-Hartpury), M Jones (Trailfinders Women, capt), H Rowland (Loughborough Lightning), E Kildunne (Harlequins); Z Harrison (Saracens), L Packer (Harlequins); K Clifford (Saracens), A Cokayne (Sale Sharks), M Muir (Gloucester-Hartpury), A Burton (Trailfinders Women), D Burns (Bristol Bears), D Short (Bristol Bears), M Packer (Saracens), M Feaunati (Exeter Chiefs). Replacements: C Powell (Harlequins), M Carson (Gloucester-Hartpury), S Bern (Bristol Bears), H Lutui (Loughborough Lightning), H Head (Trailfinders Women), F Robinson (Exeter Chiefs), H Aitchison (Sale Sharks), C Moloney-MacDonald (Exeter Chiefs).\", \"keywords\": [\"women\", \"after\", \"italy\", \"bristol\", \"gloucester\"], \"importance_score\": 15, \"credibility\": 1.0, \"langue\": \"en\", \"image_url\": \"https://e0.365dm.com/26/05/1600x900/skysports-alex-matthews-england_7239930.jpg?20260505165331\"}, {\"id\": \"94668677-f83c-4ad3-b0f9-6e28ab8cb727\", \"title\": \"Wild make switch in net for Game 2, go with Gustavsson after Wallstedt allows 8 goals against Avs\", \"url\": \"https://apnews.com/article/wild-goaltender-avalanche-stanley-cup-a50d66d724cc906a927cd8ece941df68\", \"source\": \"AP Sports\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Hockey\", \"summary\": \": denver (ap)) ):) ) ee)t) \\u03c2) tambi\\u00e9n)\\u0435) \\u0646\\u06cc\\u0632))\\u0435 )\\u0435.\", \"full_content\": \"Minnesota Wild goaltender Filip Gustavsson works out ahead of Game 1 of a first-round NHL Stanley Cup playoffs hockey series against the Dallas Stars, Saturday, April 18, 2026, in Dallas. (AP Photo/Julio Cortez) Minnesota Wild goaltender Jesper Wallstedt makes a stick-save in the first period of Game 1 of an NHL hockey Stanley Cup second-round playoff series against the Colorado Avalanche, Sunday, May 3, 2026, in Denver. (AP Photo/David Zalubowski) DENVER (AP) \\u2014 The Minnesota Wild are making a switch in net for Game 2, going with Filip Gustavsson on Tuesday night after Jesper Wallstedt allowed eight goals in a 9-6 loss to Colorado. Wild coach John Hynes announced the goaltender swap several hours before puck drop. Gustavsson hasn\\u2019t played since allowing five goals at St. Louis on April 13. He went 28-15-6 with a 2.69 goals-against average during the regular season. Wallstedt surrendered 14 goals in six games during a first-round series win over Dallas. He struggled in Game 1 against the high-scoring Avalanche in allowing eight goals on 42 shots. Wallstedt and Gustavsson split time throughout the season. \\u201cWe have confidence in both of our goalies. They\\u2019re both excellent,\\u201d Hynes said. \\u201cThey both played really good hockey. We believe either one of them can win us a game. It\\u2019s a good opportunity to get Gus in the net. He\\u2019s hungry to get in.\\u201d Gustavsson has played in 11 postseason games for the Wild, posting a 4-6 mark with a 2.54 goals-against average and a .917 save percentage. The 27-year-old Gustavsson stayed sharp waiting for his turn, Hynes said, and has been \\u201cvery supportive\\u201d of the decision to go with Wallstedt. \\u201cBut the thing I liked about it, too, was that he didn\\u2019t just concede it, either,\\u201d Hynes said. \\u201cHe wants to play. He wants to get in the net. He was working for it. He\\u2019s making sure that he was prepared to do it. \\u201cIt could be a little bit of a negative response, but his was, \\u2018I understand the decision.\\u2019 As it went on, he wanted to get into the net. But his attitude toward the team and toward Wally was top shelf.\\u201d The Wild remain without forward Joel Eriksson Ek and defenseman Jonas Brodin because of lower-body injuries. Hynes said there could be more tweaks to the lineup, but those will be game-time decisions based on health.\", \"keywords\": [\"wild\", \"gustavsson\", \"game\", \"goals\", \"against\"], \"importance_score\": 10, \"credibility\": 0.5, \"langue\": \"en\", \"image_url\": \"https://dims.apnews.com/dims4/default/e28fb82/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5199x3464+0+1/resize/980x653!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.apnews.com%2F58%2F95%2F196b6dcbdbfe621dd3e8ab758331%2Fa9393c2baa234551928331ca63ef62fc\"}, {\"id\": \"685c2e64-2425-40fc-9605-f05eb6712248\", \"title\": \"Alcoyano-Sanse y Reus-Ourense, los duelos estelares en el playoff de ascenso de 1\\u00aa Federaci\\u00f3n\", \"url\": \"https://www.marca.com/futbol/2026/05/04/alcoyano-sanse-reus-ourense-duelos-estelares-playoff-ascenso-1-federacion.html\", \"source\": \"Marca\", \"published_date\": \"2026-05-05\", \"sport\": \"Hockey\", \"summary\": \"De ascenso a primera federaci\\u00f3n - P\\u00e1gina 2 - 1 - 3 - 4 - 5.\", \"full_content\": \"El sorteo de la Federaci\\u00f3n de este lunes nos dej\\u00f3 los emparejamientos de ascenso a Primera Federaci\\u00f3n. El Alcoyano-Sanse y Reus-Ourense parten como los duelos estelares. \\u200b\\u200bAs\\u00ed quedan el resto de emparejamientos en busca de una plaza en la Primera Federaci\\u00f3n:\\u200bCoruxo - Atl\\u00e9tico BalearesReal Ja\\u00e9n - Deportivo Alav\\u00e9s BCoria - CD MineraAlcoyano - UD San Sebasti\\u00e1n de los ReyesTudelano - Real Oviedo VetustaUtebo - \\u00c1guilasGetafe B - UD Logro\\u00f1\\u00e9sReus FC Reddis - UD OurenseNumancia - UD PoblenseXerez CD - Conquense\", \"keywords\": [\"federaci\\u00f3n\", \"emparejamientos\", \"primera\", \"sorteo\", \"este\"], \"importance_scor